<title>UK: IFC adds 50 million rand to two-year bond.</title>
<headline>IFC adds 50 million rand to two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, launched for 100 million rand on December 17, 1996 has been increased to 150 million rand, lead manager Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.50     MATURITY    22.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
</text>
